## Real-World Incident

**Spring Security Annotation Bypass**. Security researchers discovered this vulnerability in Spring Boot applications affecting production systems worldwide.

**Impact:** Method security annotations not located on private methods - **CVE-2025-41232**

**Discovery:** Identified through security audit
**Remediation:** Requires Spring Boot/Spring Security version upgrade and configuration changes
**CVE:** CVE-2025-41232
**Affected Versions:** See CVE advisory for specific version ranges

